rask-fetch: dependency resolver and package fetcher

Usage: package_manager [OPTIONS] <command>

Commands:
  resolve     Resolve dependencies and print the graph
  fetch       Resolve + download packages to cache
  lock        Generate/update rask.lock
  check       Verify lock file is in sync with manifest

Options:
  --manifest PATH       Path to build.rk (default: build.rk)
  --registry local|http Registry type (default: local)
  --registry-path PATH  Local registry directory
  --registry-url URL    HTTP registry base URL
  --cache PATH          Cache directory (default: /tmp/rask-cache)
  --lock PATH           Lock file path (default: rask.lock)
  -h, --help            Show this help
